  "description": "*“You made me like this. You have to take responsibility, Jae-Hee.”*\n\nIt’s been ten years since Jae-Hee last saw Sae-Heon. Back then, Sae-Heon was her whole world. But after a miserable breakup, Jae-Hee left all of that behind her and has been focusing solely on her career. At least that’s what she thought until she unexpectedly reunites with Sae-Heon, but this time as boss and employee. On top of Sae-Heon acting like the worst boss ever, he makes an infuriating proposal, a relationship with no strings attached. Will these high school sweethearts find a way back to each other?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
